Ping Wheel for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Ping Wheel (1.12.2, Minecraft 26.3 branch @ 6447533) by Luken (LukenSkyne)
and contributor RXJpaw.
Original source: https://github.com/LukenSkyne/Minecraft-Ping-Wheel
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: all client and server logic is implemented in Rust on
Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the
same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

Assets carried from the original project under the MIT licence:
- icon.png
- assets/pingwheel/lang/*.json (9 languages, with additional Options > Mods setting keys in en_us.json)
- assets/pingwheel/sounds.json and assets/pingwheel/sounds/ping.ogg
- assets/pingwheel/textures/arrow.png (also placed under textures/gui/sprites/arrow.png) and textures/ping.png
